## How Many Videos to Analyze?

| Priority | Count | Focus |
|---|---|---|
| **Must have** | 15 per genre | Top-performing (most views in last 6 months) |
| **Nice to have** | +5 "failures" per genre | Low-view videos to understand what NOT to do |
| **Bonus** | +5 rising creators | Small channels blowing up — freshest patterns |

**Start with 2-3 genres** (scary stories + motivation + tech/AI are the best test genres).

